      <title>三星Z Fold 8热销致DDI芯片供应紧张 折叠屏供应链面临连锁压力</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260902/%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9FZ-Fold-8%E7%83%AD%E9%94%80%E8%87%B4DDI%E8%8A%AF%E7%89%87%E4%BE%9B%E5%BA%94%E7%B4%A7%E5%BC%A0-%E6%8A%98%E5%8F%A0%E5%B1%8F%E4%BE%9B%E5%BA%94%E9%93%BE%E9%9D%A2%E4%B8%B4%E8%BF%9E%E9%94%81%E5%8E%8B%E5%8A%9B/</link>
